uarantine” Poetry for now\nSo it doesn’t keep tripping things:\n\n```bash\n# From your project directory that had Poetry files\nmv pyproject.toml pyproject.toml.poetry-bak\nmv poetry.lock    poetry.lock.poetry-bak\ndeactivate 2>/dev/null || true   # leave any poetry shell\n```\n\n(You can revisit those files later when you actually want a managed build; for now they won’t interfere.)\n\n---\n\n### TL;DR\n- **Just want Zephyr up?** Use **Ollama** (Option A).  \n- **Want an HTTP endpoint now (still no FastAPI)?** Use **vLLM** (Option B).  \n\nWhen you’re ready to add the web layer, we’ll bolt **FastAPI** on top of whichever path you choose, but you don’t need it to keep moving today."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
