.dev0\"\ntorchvision = \">=0.22.0.dev0\"\ntorchaudio = \">=2.7.0.dev0\"\n```\n\nThen avoid updating them via Poetry (let pip manage these specific wheels)."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
