--\n\n> ⚠️ Local inference with **gpt-oss-20b** *on a laptop GPU* is not realistic without using quantization (4-bit QLoRA / AWQ). Would you like me to convert it to **4-bit GGUF and run it via llama-cpp** instead? That works in 8–10 GB VRAM.\n\n---\n\n**Which path do you want to take next?**\n- 🤖 Test with *Mistral-7B*\n- ⚪ Keep going *CPU-offload* with 20B\n- 🔄 Convert to *4-bit quantized* so it fits your GPU"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
