HuggingFace account before any code can download it. Otherwise → `403 Forbidden`.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Models you *can* load **without any approval or login** (and that fit your GPU):\n\n| Model | Repo ID                              | Notes             |\n|-------|---------------------------------------|-------------------|\n| 🟢 **Tiny Mistral 7B** | `mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.2`          | Base model (not gated) |\n| 🔵 **Llama-2 7B Chat** | `meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-chat-hf`       | Requires free HF login, but no manual approval |\n| 🔵 **Llama-3 8B Instruct** | `meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct` | Better, ~13 GB VRAM        |\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Suggest trying:\n```python\nmodel_id = \"mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.2\"\n```\n\nThat one is **completely open** and should download without tokens *or* gating.\n\n---\n\n### Want me to paste a ready-to-run `run.py` configured for that model (with `torch_dtype=float16` and `.half()` already in place), so you can finally get a response back from something?"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
