{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "We got the little one to load. What were your prompts again?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Nice — now we’re talking! 🎉  \nHere are a few good prompt ideas you can use to sanity-test the model’s **reasoning**, **knowledge**, and **personality**.\n\n---\n\n### 🧠 *Reasoning check*\n```\nIf a farmer has 17 sheep and all but nine die, how many are left? Explain your answer.\n```\n\n### 🎓 *General knowledge*\n```\nWho was the first female Prime Minister of India?\n```\n\n### 🔄 *Chain-of-thought / multi-step task*\n```\nSort the planets by size and describe how you arrived at your answer.\n```\n\n### 🤝 *Conversational tone*\n```\nI’m feeling burned out. What’s your best advice for staying motivated?\n```\n\n### 🌍 *Creative generation*\n```\nWrite a short sci-fi story opening set on Mars in the year 2148.\n```\n\n---\n\nWant me to build in a **menu of prompts** so each time your script runs it asks you “test knowledge / test reasoning / chat / creative” and sends a different system prompt accordingly?"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
