{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "What do I call a PC toolkit"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "You can simply call it a **PC repair toolkit**, **PC build toolkit**, or **computer technician toolkit** — all are commonly understood terms.\n\nIf you’re ordering one online, it’s often listed under:\n\n- *PC repair toolkit*\n- *Computer screwdriver set*\n- *Electronics precision toolkit*\n- *PC building tool kit*\n\n…and contains things like precision screwdrivers, nut drivers, anti-static wrist strap, tweezers, spudgers, etc.\n\nWant me to recommend a good one for building/modding PCs (with link)?"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
