*Survey System / Quiz Builder (May – Jul 2025)**\n\n- **Learned:**\n  - Django FormBuilder patterns, multi-form survey architecture\n  - UUID hashing techniques for anonymous submissions\n\n- **Built:**\n  - `surveys` Django app\n  - Feyman-Drummelberg & Programmer Experience Questionnaire modules\n  - Streamlit proof-of-concept for future LangChain chatbot-based survey\n\n---\n\n## **WeRead Book Intelligence API (Apr – May 2025)**\n\n- **Learned:**\n  - OpenLibrary, GoogleBooks, Amazon scraping/search integration\n  - Debounce + deduplication logic for fuzzy metadata\n\n- **Built:**\n  - API endpoints for searching, saving, and series grouping\n  - JS widget (book display) + reading-list scraper\n\n---\n\n## **Email / Data-Engineering Tools (Apr – Jun 2025)**\n\n- **Learned:**\n  - Parsing Gmail, ProtonMail, EPUB/XHTML structures via Python\n  - EbookLib internals and pitfalls (ordering, manifest issues)\n\n- **Built:**\n  - Gmail/ProtonMail export parser\n  - EPUB signature-insertion experiment (now shelved for fix later)\n  - Bulk book data cleaner (`clean_json.py` updates)\n\n---\n\n## **Infrastructure & Ops (Mar – Aug 2025)**\n\n- **Learned:**\n  - rclone Google Drive mounting, vfs caching, Synology/NAS setup\n  - WSL2 subsystem tuning, containerized dev workflows\n  - DigitalOcean droplets vs RunPod GPUs\n\n- **Built:**\n  - rclone-mount script (personal flow)\n  - Lava laptop BIOS + dev-env bootstrap\n  - Codespaces & Streamlit Cloud test deployments\n\n---\n\nWant me to turn this into a *living document* we can keep updating month-to-month? (Happy to set up a canvas or repo for it, if you like.)"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
