general)** | <€8,000 | Reliable fit for budget |\n| **Other hybrids (Yaris/Corolla)** | Likely >€10,000 | Keep tabs for possible deals |\n\n---\n\n###  Next Steps\n1. **Arrange viewings/test drives** for the Prius and Shuttle listings in Dublin—good condition and location make them promising.  \n2. **Expand your search** to platforms like **CarsIreland**, **Carzone**, and **DoneDeal** using the petrol hybrid + price filters (under €8k).  \n3. **Check Toyota Approved Used**—they offer hybrid health checks and extended battery care, though prices may run higher citeturn0search12.  \n4. **Verify NCT, service history, battery condition, and CO₂ emissions/VRT implications** before committing (especially for registration tax considerations) citeturn0search20.\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to pull up a shortlist of specific listings from Carzone or DoneDeal in your preferred areas or model types? Just say the word!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
