{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Toyota Yaris"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "iturn0image4\n\nHere’s a hybrid Toyota Yaris similar to what you might find on DoneDeal—I’ll dive into the current pricing landscape for these models in Ireland.\n\n---\n\n##  Toyota Yaris Hybrid — Price Overview on DoneDeal\n\nRecent listings show a variety of Toyota Yaris Hybrid options, but even the more affordable ones tend to sit **above the €8,000 mark**:\n\n- **2016 Toyota Yaris Hybrid (Walkinstown, Dublin)** – Listed at **€11,995**, includes three-month warranty and delivery option. citeturn0search5\n- **2014 Yaris Hybrid Luxury (Walkinstown, Dublin)** – Asking **€11,950**, with 113,288 km on the clock and a single Irish owner. citeturn0search0\n- **2014 Yaris Hybrid Automatic (Wexford)** – Priced at **€8,650**, mileage around 160,000 km. citeturn1search8\n- **2014 Hybrid, very low km (Finglas)** – Around **€8,950**, with low mileage and history checks. citeturn1search0\n\n---\n\n##  Pricing Summary\n\n| Year     | Price (€)     | Notes                                  |\n|----------|---------------|-----------------------------------------|\n| 2014     | ~8,650–8,950  | Older models with higher mileage         |\n| 2016     | ~10,995–11,995| Mid-age models with better spec/confidence |\n| Overall average | ~15,000    | Across all Yaris listings (hybrid & petrol) citeturn1search1turn1search5 |\n\n---\n\n##  What This Means for You\n\n- **Hybrid Yaris models remain well above your €8k budget**, with most examples listed between **€8.6k and €12k** depending on year, mileage, and dealer offer.\n- **2014 models** are the cheapest—around **€8.6k–8.9k**—but expect higher mileage and older specs.\n- If you're flexible and can stretch your budget slightly, you’ll open up **more recent and better-equipped options**.\n\n---\n\n##  Next Steps\n\n1. **Decide if stretching to €9k–€12k is possible**, to access models with lower mileage or newer safety/tech features.\n2. **Set up DoneDeal alerts** using filters like:\n   - \"Toyota Yaris Hybrid\"\n   - Price: up to €9,000 (or higher if you adjust)\n   - Location: Donegal (or nearby counties) for closer access\n3. **When evaluating listings**, always check:\n   - NCT and service history\n   - Battery and hybrid system condition (especially on older models)\n   - Seller type (dealer vs private)\n\nWould you like help setting up these alerts on DoneDeal, or comparing typical maintenance costs or reliability expectations for different Yaris model years?"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
