etching your budget or financing, these models offer solid warranty coverage and condition assurance.\n\n---\n\n##  What You Can Do Next\n\n1. **Set up alerts** with McGinley Motors (or DoneDeal filters) for hybrid/E-vehicle listings if any models within your budget emerge.\n2. **Request finance quotes**—see if payment plans can make slightly higher-priced but well-maintained models accessible to you.\n3. **Explore other nearby dealerships**, including private sales and independent dealers, for more budget-aligned EV/hybrid deals.\n\nWould you like me to search nearby dealers or platforms for hybrid/EVs closer to your €5–8k range—or help you draft an inquiry to McGinley Motors?"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
