ng options. ([source]citeturn0search4)\n\n- **Hegarty’s Ford**:\n  Ford main dealer with over 50 pre-owned vehicles. Offers AA-approved checks, Cartell history reports, finance support, and service facilities. ([source]citeturn0search6)\n\n---\n\n###  What to Do Next\n\nHere’s how you can narrow things down:\n\n- **Visit dealership websites** to filter by your preferred make, fuel type (hybrid, electric, petrol), budget range, and year.\n- **Contact sales teams** directly to inquire about urgent needs or out-of-stock models within your €5K–€8K range.\n- **Tour dealerships in person**, especially those offering full warranties or AA/Cartell vehicle reports for added confidence.\n- **Combine with online marketplaces** like DoneDeal to keep your options open—from trade-in deals to private listings.\n\nWant help searching for available stock matching your budget or fuel preferences at one of these dealerships? I'm happy to assist!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
