onda Civic, Kia Stinger, Toyota Corolla, Ford Kuga, Peugeot 3008, Toyota RAV4, and more — covering petrol, diesel, and hybrid options citeturn0search5.\n\n---\n\n##  Summary Table\n\n| Dealership             | Stock Highlights                          | Notable Hybrids / Price Points                        |\n|------------------------|--------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------|\n| **Shane Connolly Cars** | ~90–108 used cars; many with warranty      | 2023 Yaris Hybrid (~€21.9k); 2021 BMW X5 Hybrid (~€52.9k) |\n| **Colm Dillon Cars**    | ~100+ cars; wide variety, daily updates     | 2018 Yaris Hybrid (price on request)                   |\n\n---\n\n##  How to Proceed\n\n- **Reach out to both dealerships** for full price details on models like the 2018 Toyota Yaris Hybrid at Colm Dillon.\n- **Request vehicle histories, condition reports, and discuss finance options**, especially for models over €8k.\n- **Visit or test-drive** to inspect NCT status, servicing, and confirm hybrid system health.\n\nIf you'd like help drafting messages to either dealer or narrowing down models by budget and type, I’m here to assist further!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
