AG search engine for your own use  \n✅ Run Ollama or LM Studio with fast chat\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 **Why do you want 64 GB RAM?**\nBecause:\n- LLaMA 8B q4_K_M quantized → ~10–14 GB RAM  \n- **RAG embedding** will load full database in memory — your chat, email, novels = LOTS of tokens  \n- Fine-tuning with QLoRA + Axolotl → 32 GB *works*, but 64 GB makes it comfortable\n\n---\n\n### **Budget builds**\n\n| Target              | Hardware |\n|---------------------|----------|\n| \"Laptop for testing\" | Macbook M3 Max 64 GB (works GREAT for 7B) |\n| \"Budget desktop\"    | Ryzen 7 7800X3D, RTX 4070 Ti, 64 GB RAM |\n| \"Dream desktop\"     | Ryzen 9 7950X3D, RTX 4090, 128 GB RAM |\n\n---\n\n### If you already tell me:\n✅ Your **current PC** (CPU, RAM, GPU)  \n✅ Willing to upgrade? Yes/No  \n✅ Want this to **travel** (laptop) or be desktop?\n\n…I can give you an exact **Todd Avatar Build spec** for this year.\n\n---\n\n**Summary**:  \n👉 64 GB RAM is a must  \n👉 GPU 12–24 GB VRAM is ideal  \n👉 SSD 2 TB if you want *all models + checkpoints*\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to map you a:\n1️⃣ \"Minimum you can use today with current PC\"  \n2️⃣ \"Ideal desktop 2025 spec\"  \n3️⃣ \"Portable Todd Avatar laptop spec\"\n\nJust tell me! 🚀  \nReady when you are."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
