ideal — don’t waste $$ on 6400+  \nX670E BIOS is now mature enough for 128 GB at 6000\n\n---\n\n## 🧊 2️⃣ **Cooling combos (quiet workstation)**\n\n### 🆒 **AIO Liquid Cooling (360mm)**\n\n| Model                                 | Notes |\n|---------------------------------------|-------|\n| Arctic Liquid Freezer III 360 A-RGB    | Top performer, super quiet, great value |\n| NZXT Kraken Elite 360                  | Premium, looks great, very quiet |\n| Corsair iCUE H150i Elite LCD           | Great RGB/control — Corsair fans |\n| BeQuiet Silent Loop 2 360              | Ultra-silent build (great for audio room) |\n\n---\n\n### 🆒 **Top air cooling (if you hate liquid)**\n\n| Model                            | Notes |\n|----------------------------------|-------|\n| Noctua NH-D15S Chromax.Black      | Legend — dead quiet, great for 7950X3D |\n| Deepcool Assassin IV              | Cheaper, very good new gen air cooler |\n| BeQuiet Dark Rock Pro 5           | Quiet focus — great for workstations |\n\n---\n\n**Air vs AIO?**  \n👉 If you’re leaving your machine on all day running LLaMA — **AIO 360mm is best**  \n👉 If you want no-risk, no-liquid → **NH-D15S** is excellent (but big!)\n\n---\n\n### 🏆 **TL;DR Full Pick List**\n\n| Component        | Pick |\n|------------------|------|\n| **CPU**          | Ryzen 9 7950X3D |\n| **MB**           | ASUS ProArt X670E Creator WiFi |\n| **RAM**          | G.Skill Z5 DDR5-6000 CL30 (128 GB) |\n| **GPU**          | NVIDIA RTX 4090 |\n| **SSD**          | 2 TB Samsung 990 Pro Gen 4 + 2 TB Crucial T700 Gen 5 |\n| **Cooler**       | Arctic Liquid Freezer III 360 A-RGB |\n| **PSU**          | Corsair RM1000x SHIFT / Seasonic Vertex GX-1000 |\n| **Case**         | Fractal North XL / Lian Li PC-O11D Evo / BeQuiet 802 |\n\n---\n\nIf you like, I can also prep:\n\n✅ **PCPartPicker link**  \n✅ Build notes (BIOS tuning for AI work — eg: PBO / CO / RAM timings)  \n✅ LLaMA / Axolotl / Ollama optimized setup (for when you’re ready to build!)\n\n---\