\n---\n\n## 🧭 Why This Build?\n\n- **Ryzen 9 7950X3D** + **RTX 5090** = unmatched compute for LLMs  \n- **32 GB VRAM** ensures even large-context fine-tuning works  \n- **128 GB RAM** and fast NVMe drives future-proof the system  \n- **Top-tier cooling & PSU** keep it silent and stable under load\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Ordering Tips & Next Steps\n\n1. **Create alerts** on Mindfactory.de and Caseking.de for \"RTX 5090\"  \n2. Confirm current pricing—drop below €2,800, pull trigger  \n3. Grab rest of components (MB, CPU, RAM, SSD, etc.) locally in Ireland/EU  \n4. Wait for stock or restocks—locking motherboard and case early is wise  \n5. **Build together**: I can guide BIOS tuning, driver install, Ubuntu setup\n\n---\n\nLet me know when you want me to:\n\n- 🧩 Build the full PCPartPicker URL  \n- 🔧 Provide BIOS setup notes & Ubuntu install guide  \n- 🧠 Walk you through system assembly and testing\n\nYou're one stock alert away from owning a **next-gen Todd LLM Workstation** ready for all your AI and writing work. 🚀"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
