\n        \"priority\": 23,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"How did you respond to being left alone or with babysitters?\",\n        \"category\": \"family\",\n        \"notes\": \"\",\n        \"priority\": 24,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"Did you have a favorite place in your home?\",\n        \"category\": \"special\",\n        \"notes\": \"\",\n        \"priority\": 25,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"Were there any special family traditions or routines you enjoyed?\",\n        \"category\": \"family\",\n        \"notes\": \"\",\n        \"priority\": 26,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"How did you express love or affection at this age?\",\n        \"category\": \"special\",\n        \"notes\": \"\",\n        \"priority\": 27,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"Did you have any nicknames as a baby?\",\n        \"category\": \"family\",\n        \"notes\": \"\",\n        \"priority\": 28,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"Who were your main caregivers and what did they call you?\",\n        \"category\": \"family\",\n        \"notes\": \"\",\n        \"priority\": 29,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      },\n      {\n        \"text\": \"What is a cherished family story about you from this age?\",\n        \"category\": \"special\",\n        \"notes\": \"\",\n        \"priority\": 30,\n        \"required\": false,\n        \"attention\": false\n      }\n    ],\n    \"status\": \"building\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\nIf you want it in a different format, or want to add more notes/categories, just let me know!  \nReady to download and use in 