{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Can you give me that timeline you worked up from my Wikipedia entry?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Absolutely! Here’s a **fast, clean timeline** for you (Todd McCaffrey) based on your Wikipedia entry and previous Q&A. This is formatted for Google Sheets or CSV import:\n\n---\n\n**Year,Age,Event,Details,Tags**  \n1956,0,Born in Montclair, New Jersey,\"Born as Todd Johnson, second son of Anne McCaffrey\",birth,family  \n1965,9,Family moved to Sea Cliff, Long Island,\"After Wilmington, Delaware and Düsseldorf, Germany\",move,family  \n1968,12,Attended first science fiction convention,\"Lunacon in New York City\",hobby,interest  \n1970,14,Started writing stories,\"Early writing interests, inspired by science fiction\",hobby,writing  \n1974,18,Graduated high school,\"Completed secondary education\",education,school  \n1974,18,Entered college,\"Studied engineering at Columbia University\",education,college  \n1978,22,Graduated from Columbia University,\"Degree in engineering\",education,graduation  \n1979,23,Joined US Army,\"Became a second lieutenant, armored branch\",career,army  \n1982,26,Left Army,\"Returned to civilian life\",career,transition  \n1986,30,First published science fiction story,\"Short fiction debut\",writing,publishing  \n1988,32,Co-authored first Pern book with Anne McCaffrey,\"Dragon's Eye (US: The Renegades of Pern)\",writing,collaboration  \n1990,34,Full-time writer,\"Pursued writing as a career\",writing,career  \n2003,47,Published first solo Pern novel,\"Dragonsblood\",writing,publishing  \n2011,55,Death of Anne McCaffrey,\"Mother and co-author passed away\",family,loss  \n2025,69,Working on LLM, digital legacy projects,\"University of Souls, AI persona project\",tech,LLM\n\n---\n\n**Copy-Paste for Google Sheets:**  \nJust copy the section above (from “Year,Age,Event…”) and paste into Google Sheets—columns will separate automatically.\n\n---\n\nWould you like a downloadable CSV file,