0+       |\n| **Total**    | ~203 deaths     |\n\n- There are **~203 confirmed deaths**.\n- Approximately **half** are humans; the rest are animals.\n- Many occur off-screen or in flashbacks, reflecting the show’s dark tone citeturn0search0turn0search1.\n\n---\n\nWould you like a fully itemized list per episode or details on specific deaths? I can tailor it however you'd like!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
