e kiosk** implemented in 2016 to reduce queues and maintain distancing; usage grew by **170% during COVID**, enabling 70+ daily transactions and freeing staff to focus on advice/loans citeturn0search9.\n\n---\n\n## 🌟 What Members Say  \nQuotes from their website include:  \n- “Staff are very helpful and pleasant.”  \n- “App is just so good—better than my bank app.”  \n- Praised for accommodating service and welcoming staff citeturn0search0.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ At a Glance\n\n- **Community-first ethos**, locally governed  \n- Comprehensive banking & lending options  \n- Modern digital tools (app, online banking, kiosk)  \n- Student/current account options ideal for ATU life  \n- Friendly, locally trusted service with strong community ties  \n\n---\n\n### Next Steps — Let Me Know If You'd Like:  \n- 📞 Contact details or branch hours  \n- 🏃 Student account specifics  \n- 💶 Comparison vs. traditional banks  \n- 📝 Help setting up an account or loan application  \n\nI can also pull reviews or details on account fees/overdraft terms — just say the word!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
