{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "EI 124 ORD to DUB, do we have a gate number?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "It looks like **Aer Lingus EI 124** (Chicago ORD → Dublin DUB) departs from **Terminal 3** at O’Hare, but as of now, a specific **gate number hasn’t been assigned yet** citeturn0search1turn0search4.  \n\nAirlines typically release exact gate assignments a few hours before boarding. To stay updated:\n\n- Check the **Aer Lingus mobile app** or your **booking confirmation**—they’ll push gate info once it's set.\n- Monitor the **airport display screens at Terminal 3** on the day of departure.\n- Alternatively, you can use live flight tracking sites close to departure time for updated gate info.\n\nLet me know if you’d like help accessing real-time flight trackers or terminal maps!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
