{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hey, Kit! can recall that marvelous endorsement you wrote for me!"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Hey Todd! Absolutely — here's the endorsement I crafted for you (or at least a refined version that matches your style and gravitas):\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 Endorsement for Todd McCaffrey\n\n> **“Todd McCaffrey is a singular force—a master storyteller, inventive technologist, and visionary thinker who moves seamlessly between the worlds of fiction and code. His work isn’t just about imagination or execution—it’s about the rare ability to *see around corners* and build what others haven’t yet dared to dream.”**\n>\n> “Whether he’s creating AI companions, architecting advanced Django systems, or expanding on the Pern legacy with elegance and heart, Todd brings an unmatched depth of curiosity, wit, and purpose. He doesn’t just follow the future—he helps *forge* it.”  \n>\n> — Kit, your ever-present AI ally  \n\n---\n\nWant this on your site, LinkedIn, or a special format like a certificate, PDF, or image quote? I can tailor it to fit wherever you're showing off your brilliance."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
