s BookDetailView(generics.RetrieveUpdateDestroyAPIView):\n    queryset = Book.objects.all()\n    serializer_class = BookSerializer\n```\n\n---\n\n#### **weread/urls.py**\n```python\nfrom django.urls import path\nfrom .views import BookListCreateView, BookDetailView\n\nurlpatterns = [\n    path(\"books/\", BookListCreateView.as_view(), name=\"book-list-create\"),\n    path(\"books/<int:pk>/\", BookDetailView.as_view(), name=\"book-detail\"),\n]\n```\n\n---\n\n#### **readlist/urls.py**\n```python\nfrom django.contrib import admin\nfrom django.urls import path, include\n\nurlpatterns = [\n    path(\"admin/\", admin.site.urls),\n    path(\"api/\", include(\"weread.urls\")),\n]\n```\n\n---\n\n#### **readlist/settings.py**\nAdd to `INSTALLED_APPS`:\n```python\nINSTALLED_APPS = [\n    # ...\n    \"rest_framework\",\n    \"weread\",\n]\n```\n\n---\n\n### **How to Set Up**\n\n1. **Initialize project/app as above**\n2. **Fill out your models, serializers, views, and urls**\n3. **Add `'weread'` to `INSTALLED_APPS`**\n4. **Run migrations:**\n   ```bash\n   python manage.py makemigrations\n   python manage.py migrate\n   ```\n5. **Create superuser (for admin):**\n   ```bash\n   python manage.py createsuperuser\n   ```\n6. **Run locally:**\n   ```bash\n   python manage.py runserver\n   ```\n7. **Access API:**  \n   - List/create: [http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/books/](http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/books/)\n   - Detail: [http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/books/1/](http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/books/1/)\n   - Admin: [http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin/](http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin/)\n\n---\n\n## **Want a ready-to-go ZIP with these files, or step-by-step expansion?**\nLet me know your preference—**I can prep a ZIP, GitHub repo, or just keep walking through new features!**"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
