n---\n\n✅ Result:\n\n`/qotd/api/random/` → JSON (DRF)  \n`/qotd/` → HTML views, admin pages (optional)  \n\n---\n\n**This is a good practice!**  \nKeeps your API separate, easier to maintain, easier to version (v1, v2 later if you want).\n\n---\n\n**If you want, I can also generate:**\n\n✅ The full `qotd` app structure (ready to drop in)  \n✅ The parser (CLI + web UI option)  \n✅ A `management/commands/import_quotes.py` to bulk load JSON\n\n---\n\nWould you like me to generate a ready-to-use **qotd app skeleton** with this structure? 🚀  \nJust say *go*!  \nWe are building a **clean, reusable app** here — future-proof! 🚀"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
