data['author']\nexcept Exception:\n    quote_text = \"Keep going. Everything you need will come to you.\"\n    quote_author = \"Unknown\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. **Check for Docker Network Issues**\nIf you’re running inside Docker, the container needs to be able to access the public internet.  \nTry from inside your container:\n```bash\ncurl https://api.quotable.io/random\n```\nIf it fails but works outside Docker, your Docker network config may be blocking outgoing requests.\n\n---\n\n## 6. **Temporary Outage**\nIt’s possible Quotable is experiencing a temporary outage. These services do go down occasionally.\n\n---\n\n**TL;DR:**  \n- If you want a quick fix, switch to another API like ZenQuotes or Favqs.\n- If your network is blocking it, try from another device or network.\n- If the API is down, just wait or use a fallback!\n\nWant a drop-in replacement using ZenQuotes or Favqs?"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
