\n    .fl-welcome-flex { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 1.3em; }\n    .fl-header-left, .fl-header-right { max-width: 100%; border-radius: 1.2em; }\n    .fl-header-logo { margin-right: 1em; }\n    .fl-header-right { border-left: none; border-top: 4px solid #5b79c8; align-items: flex-start; }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"w3-container\">\n  <div class=\"fl-welcome-flex\">\n    <!-- Foxxe Labs: logo and welcome text (left) -->\n    <div class=\"fl-header-left\">\n      <img src=\"{% static 'images/FoxxeLabs.png' %}\" alt=\"Foxxe Labs Logo\" class=\"fl-header-logo w3-image\"/>\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"w3-xxlarge w3-text-indigo\" style=\"margin: 0 0 0.15em 0;\">Welcome to Foxxe Labs!</h2>\n        <p class=\"w3-large\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Explore surveys, share your thoughts, and see what’s new every day.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- Quote of the Day (right) -->\n    <div class=\"fl-header-right\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"fl-qotd-quote\">&#10077; {{ quote_text }} &#10078;</div>\n        <div class=\"fl-qotd-author\">&mdash; {{ quote_author }}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"w3-bar w3-margin-top w3-animate-opacity\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1em;justify-content:center;\">\n    <a href=\"{% url 'lander' %}\" class=\"w3-button w3-indigo w3-hover-blue w3-round-xxlarge w3-padding-large w3-card-2\" style=\"transition:.2s;\">Lunar Lander</a>\n    <a href=\"{% url 'internet_quiz' %}\" class=\"w3-button w3-indigo w3-hover-blue w3-round-xxlarge w3-padding-large w3-card-2\" style=\"transition:.2s;\">Internet Quiz</a>\n    <a href=\"{% url 'programmer_survey' %}\" class=\"w3-button w3-indigo w3-hover-blue w3-round-xxlarge w3-padding-large w3-card-2\" style=\"transition:.2s;\">Programmer Survey</a>\n    <a href=\"{% url 'about' %}\" class=\"w3-button w3-purple w3-hover-deep-purple w3-round-xxlarge w3-padding-large w3-card-2\" style=\"transition:.2s;\">About</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n{% endblock content %}\n```\n\n---\n\n### **What’s different?**\n\n- The **left (logo + welcome)** card uses a pale blue (`#e3ecfa`), which is soft and W3.CSS compatible.\n- The **Quote of the Day** card uses a rich, stylized blue gradient, with soft blue text and a highlighted border.\n- Both cards are responsive, rounded, and clean.\n- **QOTD** now stands out and doesn’t get lost.\n\nYou can **adjust colors** further to taste—just say if you want tweaks!\n\n---\n\nLet me know if you want a ZIP or want to drop this right into your template."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "I'd like to improve the look and feel on this about page. Also, let's add a pretty link to \"https://toddmccaffrey.com\""}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Absolutely, here’s how you can make your **about page** feel more welcoming, visually balanced, and professional, while featuring a polished button link to [toddmccaffrey.com](https://toddmccaffrey.com):\n\n---\n\n**Recommended Enhancements:**\n- Subtle gradient background for depth.\n- Center the card, add a gentle border or drop shadow.\n- Larger, friendlier author photo.\n- A modern call-to-action button linking to your website.\n- A dash of accent color on the name and button.\n- A short inspirational tagline or “mission statement.”\n\n---\n\n### Improved `about.html`\n\n```html\n{% extends \"pages/base.html\" %}\n{% load static %}\n\n{% block title %}About{% endblock title %}\n\n{% block content %}\n<!-- Gradient background for the about section -->\n<div class=\"w3-content w3-padding-32\" style=\"max-width:900px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3ecfc 0%, #f5f8fd 100%); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow:0 2px 24px #0002;\">\n  <div class=\"w3-row w3-card w3-white w3-round-large w3-padding-32 w3-center\" style=\"box-shadow:0 2px 16px #0003;\">\n    <div class=\"w3-col s12 m4 w3-center w3-padding-large\">\n      <img src=\"{% static 'images/todd.jpg' %}\" alt=\"Todd McCaffrey\"\n           style=\"width:200px;max-width:85vw;box-shadow:0 2px 16px #0002;border:6px solid #e3ecfc;\"\n           class=\"w3-image w3-circle w3-card-4 w3-margin-bottom\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w3-col s12 m8 w3-padding-large w3-left-align\">\n      <h1 class=\"w3-jumbo w3-text-indigo\" style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue','Russo One',Impact,sans-serif;margin-bottom:8px;\">Todd McCaffrey</h1>\n      <p class=\"w3-large w3-opacity w3-margin-bottom\" style=\"font-style:italic;\">\n        Novelist • Technologist • Creative Thinker\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"w3-xlarge w3-text-grey w3-margin-bottom\">\n        I blend 50+ years of programming with a lifelong passion for storytelling. Whether crafting Django web apps or publishing science fiction and fantasy, I love building tools and tales that inspire.\n      </p>\n      <ul class=\"w3-ul w3-large w3-left-align\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px;\">\n        <li>✨ MFA in Fine Arts</li>\n        <li>✨ Author of <em>L.A. Witch</em>, <em>The Canaris Rift</em>, and more</li>\n        <li>✨ Django & Python developer</li>\n        <li>✨ Advocate for creative, human-centered technology</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"w3-large\">\n        <a href=\"https://toddmccaffrey.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n           class=\"w3-button w3-indigo w3-round-large w3-xlarge w3-hover-blue w3-padding-large\"\n           style=\"text-shadow:0 1px 0 #fff;\">\n          <i class=\"fa fa-globe w3-margin-right\"></i>\n          Visit my author site\n        </a>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n{% endblock content %}\n```\n\n---\n\n**How this looks and feels:**\n- The background gradient adds depth but stays light and subtle.\n- Author photo is larger and outlined for focus.\n- Bio info is friendly, concise, and visually grouped.\n- The website button is big, inviting, and matches your accent color.\n- Everything is responsive and works well with W3.CSS.\n\nIf you want more tweaks (e.g., different accent color, more sections, or a testimonial carousel), let me know!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
