{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "yes, give me the updated HTML"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here is your updated `tag_grid.html` template with the conditional \"Download CSV\" button:\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <title>Image Tagging</title>\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/select2@4.1.0-rc.0/dist/css/select2.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n    <style>\n        .grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }\n        .image-box { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; width: 220px; }\n        img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }\n        .tag-select { width: 100%; margin-top: 5px; }\n        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 12px; background: #28a745; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <h1>Tag Images</h1>\n\n    {% if show_export_button %}\n      <p><a href=\"{% url 'export_tagged_csv' %}\" class=\"button\">📥 Download CSV</a></p>\n    {% endif %}\n\n    <form method=\"post\">\n        {% csrf_token %}\n        {% load custom_filters %}\n        <div class=\"grid\">\n            {% for image in images %}\n                <div class=\"image-box\">\n                    <img src=\"{{ image.file.url }}\" alt=\"Image\">\n                    <select class=\"tag-select\" name=\"tags_{{ image.id }}\" multiple=\"multiple\">\n                        {% for tag in all_tags %}\n                            <option value=\"{{ tag.name }}\"\n                                {% if tag.name in tag_data|get_item:image.id %}selected{% endif %}>\n                                {{ tag.name }}\n                            </option>\n                        {% endfor %}\n                    </select>\n                </div>\n            {% endfor %}\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\">Save Tags</button>\n    </form>\n\n    <script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.6.0.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/select2@4.1.0-rc.0/dist/js/select2.min.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n            $('.tag-select').select2({\n                tags: true,\n                tokenSeparators: [','],\n                width: '100%'\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\n✅ Place this in:  \n`tagger/templates/tagger/tag_grid.html`\n\nLet me know if you'd like to:\n- Highlight newly tagged images\n- Add bulk tagging actions\n- Export JSON for model training instead of CSV"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
