h.  \n✅ Know which cover converts best  \n✅ Improve your blurb for clicks  \n✅ Save money on ads\n\nJoin the early access list — first 50 users get 50% off for life!\n\n[Join Now]  \n```\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 Funnel:\n\n1️⃣ Use FB author groups + Foxxe Frey newsletter → send traffic to the landing page  \n2️⃣ Start with €25/test offer (low friction)  \n3️⃣ Later → Add €49/mo “Pro” plan with unlimited tests\n\n---\n\nIf you want, I can now:  \n✅ Draft the full landing page (HTML/React/whatever you want)  \n✅ Write the MVP tech stack (Django apps, Stripe, DB, front-end)  \n✅ Suggest marketing partners / places to post this\n\nWould you like me to prep those? 🚀"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
