{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "yes, please!"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here we go — step-by-step:\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 1️⃣ Starter Django Repo: What to include\n\nI can generate this for you (if you say go):\n\n**Repo Structure**\n\n```\nfoxxelabs-platform/\n├── foxxelabs/               # Django project\n│   ├── settings.py\n│   ├── urls.py\n│   └── wsgi.py\n├── lab/                     # Django app for Cover & Blurb Tests\n│   ├── models.py\n│   ├── views.py\n│   ├── forms.py\n│   ├── templates/lab/\n│   │   └── landing.html\n│   └── static/lab/          # (Optional styling)\n├── requirements.txt\n├── manage.py\n├── README.md\n```\n\n**Features included:**\n\n✅ Landing page (HTML above, ready to wire)  \n✅ Django Allauth for user auth (signup/login)  \n✅ Stripe billing integration stub (sub & one-off)  \n✅ Simple model for \"Test\" (cover/blurb upload, results)  \n✅ Admin panel ready  \n✅ Ready to deploy on Railway/Fly.io  \n\n---\n\n### ✅ 2️⃣ Author Pitch Email (for Beta Testers)\n\n**Subject:** Help Us Test a New Author Tool — Get Early Access!\n\n---\n\nHi [Author Name],\n\nWe're launching a new tool from Foxxe Labs — designed to help authors test their **covers** and **blurbs** with real readers *before launch*. \n\nIf you've ever wondered:\n\n- \"Which cover will convert better?\"\n- \"Is my blurb helping or hurting my sales?\"\n- \"How can I save money on ads?\"\n\nThen we’d love your help as an early beta tester!\n\nAs a beta user, you’ll get:\n\n✅ Early access before public launch  \n✅ 50% lifetime discount  \n✅ Personal feedback on your test results  \n✅ Direct influence on features\n\nIf you're interested, just reply to this email or click here to join the list:\n\n👉 [Your landing page URL]\n\nLooking forward to helping you sell more books!\n\nCheers,  \nTodd McCaffrey  \nFoxxe Labs  \n\n---\n\n### ✅ 3️⃣ 12-Week Build Schedule\n\n| Week  | Milestone |\n|-------|-----------|\n| 1     | Launch landing page, collect 50-100 earl