{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "django/React site scaffold?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"foxxe_labs_site\",\n  \"type\": \"code/react\",\n  \"content\": \"import { Card, CardContent } from \\\"@/components/ui/card\\\";\\nimport { Button } from \\\"@/components/ui/button\\\";\\nimport { useEffect, useState } from \\\"react\\\";\\n\\nexport default function FoxxeLabsHome() {\\n  const [quote, setQuote] = useState(\\\"\\\");\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    fetch(\\\"/api/branding\\\")\\n      .then((res) => res.json())\\n      .then((data) => setQuote(data.tagline));\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"min-h-screen bg-orange-500 text-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center\\\">\\n      <Card className=\\\"max-w-xl w-full shadow-xl bg-white text-black rounded-2xl p-6\\\">\\n        <CardContent>\\n          <h1 className=\\\"text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-orange-500\\\">Foxxe Labs</h1>\\n          <p className=\\\"text-lg mb-6\\\">\\n            {quote || \\\"Engineering stories. Building futures.\\\"}\\n          </p>\\n          <Button className=\\\"bg-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-800 text-white rounded-xl\\\">\\n            Explore Projects\\n          </Button>\\n        </CardContent>\\n      </Card>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\"\n}\n\nHere's a React front-end scaffold for the **Foxxe Labs** site. It includes:\n\n- A vibrant orange and blue theme\n- A tagline fetched from a Django API endpoint (`/api/branding`)\n- A stylized card layout with a prominent **Foxxe Labs** title and CTA button\n\nNext, I can scaffold the matching Django backend:\n\n- `branding` app with a `tagline` API\n- Django REST Framework setup\n- CORS + static files config\n\nWant me to proceed with that?"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
