\"\\nRunning tests in: {self.__class__.__name__}\")\n    create_test_google_social_app()\n```\n\nThis includes:\n- `LoginLogoutTests`\n- `SignupTests`\n- `URLTests`\n\n> If you're unsure, add it to all test classes except `CustomUserTests`.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Cleanup: Updated `create_test_google_social_app()` (no ID assumption)\n\n```python\ndef create_test_google_social_app():\n    site, _ = Site.objects.get_or_create(domain=\"localhost\", name=\"localhost\")\n    app, _ = SocialApp.objects.get_or_create(\n        provider=\"google\",\n        name=\"Google\",\n        client_id=\"test-client-id\",\n        secret=\"test-secret-key\",\n    )\n    app.sites.set([site])\n    return app\n```\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Want Me to Generate the Final Working `tests.py`?\n\nI can generate a fully working, corrected version of `tests.py` with:\n- all `setUp()`s updated\n- `SocialApp` and `SocialToken` fixes applied\n- a clean, reusable Google SSO mock\n\nJust say the word and I’ll output it in one go."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
