istration/login.html\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Summary\n\nAfter migration, your layout should be:\n\n```\ntemplates/\n├── base.html\n├── registration/\n│   ├── login.html\n│   └── signup.html\n├── pages/\n│   └── home.html\n```\n\nLet me know if you'd like me to script this entire migration as a bash file or generate an updated `README.md` with this template consolidation process."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
