edMixin` Only (if All Authenticated Users Should Access)\n\nIf you don’t need fine-grained permission checks and just want the view to be restricted to logged-in users, change the class inheritance from:\n\n```python\nclass OwnerCourseMixin(OwnerMixin, LoginRequiredMixin, PermissionRequiredMixin):\n```\n\nto:\n\n```python\nclass OwnerCourseMixin(OwnerMixin, LoginRequiredMixin):\n```\n\nAnd remove `permission_required = 'courses.view_course'` from views using it.\n\n---\n\nLet me know which path you'd like to take, and I can help with next steps — or help add `view_course` automatically to staff users."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
