e Dashboard → Developers → API Keys](https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys)\n\n- **Delete the exposed key**\n- **Generate a new one**\n- **Update your local `.env`**\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Use `.gitignore` to Prevent This in the Future**\n\nAdd this line to `.gitignore`:\n\n```\n.env\n```\n\nThen commit:\n\n```bash\ngit add .gitignore\ngit commit -m \"Ignore .env file to protect secrets\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Bonus: Use `python-decouple` or `django-environ`\n\nUse `.env` files with libraries like `python-decouple`:\n\n```python\nfrom decouple import config\nstripe.api_key = config('STRIPE_SECRET_KEY')\n```\n\n---\n\nLet me know if you'd like a script to help scrub secrets or set up `.env` file handling properly!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
