isted in `INSTALLED_APPS` in `settings.py`?\n\n  ```python\n  INSTALLED_APPS = [\n      ...\n      'coupons',\n  ]\n  ```\n\n- Did you run migrations for it?\n\n  ```bash\n  python manage.py makemigrations\n  python manage.py migrate\n  ```\n\n- Did you restart your server?\n\n  ```bash\n  python manage.py runserver\n  ```\n\n---\n\nOnce the model is registered in the admin, visiting `/admin/coupons/coupon/add/` will work.\n\nLet me know if you want help creating the `Coupon` model or building a discount logic system!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
