bit,” “World-Building Through Character”  \n\n---\n\n### **PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE**\n\n**Author**  \n*Self-Employed / Major Publishers* — 2002–present  \nLead author on bestselling novels and short stories. Worked with top editors and publicists. Created and marketed both solo and collaborative titles.\n\n**Software & Aerospace Professional**  \n*Various U.S. and Irish Firms* — 1980s–2000s  \nManaged and developed systems for defense and aviation. Specialized in logistics simulation, system architecture, and technical documentation. Licensed pilot with experience in aeronautics.\n\n---\n\n### **EDUCATION**\n\n- **M.F.A., Creative Writing** – Claremont Graduate University  \n- **B.A. (Hons), Mathematics and Computing** – Trinity College Dublin  \n- FAA-Certified Private Pilot  \n- U.S. Army ROTC Graduate  \n\n---\n\n### **SKILLS**\n\n- Writing: Fiction, nonfiction, screenwriting, technical  \n- Tech: Python, Django, Flask, Git, HTML, JavaScript  \n- Tools: InDesign, Photoshop, VS Code, GitHub  \n- Languages: English (native), French (conversational), German (basic)  \n\n---\n\n### **AWARDS & RECOGNITION**\n\n- *New York Times* Bestseller List (multiple books)  \n- Featured: *Locus*, *Publishers Weekly*, *SFX*  \n- Honored Guest at global conventions  \n\n---\n\nLet me know if you'd like this output styled for:\n- A **PDF download**\n- A **Word document**\n- A **LinkedIn profile**\n- Or a **print-ready CV**\n\nI can also add sections on grants, residencies, teaching experience, or media coverage if desired."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
