{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "create a one-sheet output to stdout"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Certainly! Here's a professionally formatted **one-sheet** for **Todd J. McCaffrey**, ideal for event organizers, media kits, or promotional handouts.\n\n---\n\n# **Todd J. McCaffrey**  \n*Author • Engineer • Speaker • NYT Bestseller*\n\n📍 Las Vegas, NV  \n📧 todd@toddwriter.com  \n🌐 [www.toddmccaffrey.com](http://www.toddmccaffrey.com)  \n📞 (818) 324-5127\n\n---\n\n## **About Todd**\n\nTodd J. McCaffrey is a **New York Times bestselling author** and the son of legendary writer Anne McCaffrey. He is best known for continuing the iconic *Dragonriders of Pern* series, having co-authored and written multiple novels set in that universe.\n\nA polymath with a background in aerospace engineering, software development, and storytelling, Todd holds an **MFA in Fine Arts** from **Claremont Graduate University** and a **Bachelor of Science in Mechanical Engineering** from **Trinity College Dublin**. He is also a **licensed pilot**, Army veteran, and an accomplished public speaker.\n\n---\n\n## **Selected Works**\n\n- 🛸 *Raw Space* – An original space opera  \n- 🐉 *Dragon Harper*, *Dragon’s Time*, *Dragongirl* – Co-authored Pern novels  \n- ⚙️ *The Steam Crown* – A steampunk epic  \n- 🧙 *L.A. Witch* series (as Talla Hill) – Urban fantasy  \n- ❄️ *Winter Wyvern* – Young adult fantasy\n\n---\n\n## **Expertise & Topics**\n\n- Writing in shared universes and literary legacies  \n- Science fiction and fantasy worldbuilding  \n- Storytelling through software and interactive fiction  \n- Aerospace and military-inspired narratives  \n- Technology in speculative fiction\n\n---\n\n## **Speaking Highlights**\n\n- **DragonCon**, **WorldCon**, **Comic-Con International**  \n- Featured panelist and workshop leader  \n- Topics:  \n  - *Legacy in Science Fiction*  \n  - *Building Fictional Worlds with Real Tools*  \n  - *The Art of Writing Collaboratively*\n\n---\n\n## **Quick Facts**\n\n✅ 78 books published under 4 names  \n🧠 Former Senior Engineer in aerospace & tech  \n🛩 FAA-Certified Pilot  \n🎖 U.S. Army Commendation Medal recipient  \n🎓 Also attended: Pierce & Norco Colleges  \n\n---\n\n*Available for interviews, speaking engagements, media appearances, and consulting.*  \n📩 **Contact:** todd@toddwriter.com\n\n---\n\nLet me know if you’d like this exported to PDF or styled for print or web use."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
