- *Ghost War series* (as **Talla Hill**) – Supernatural military thriller  \n\n---\n\n## **PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE**  \n- **Senior Software Engineer** – Locus Computing Corporation  \n- **Lead QA & Engineer** – PLATINUM technology  \n- **Founder & Developer** – Symas Corporation  \n- **Senior Engineer** – Countrywide Financial  \n- **Java Developer** – Oxelis  \n- **Software Engineer** – LRN\n\n---\n\n## **SPEAKING & MEDIA APPEARANCES**  \n- Guest – DragonCon, WorldCon, Comic-Con International  \n- Guest Lecturer – U.S. Air Force Academy  \n- Speaker – **American Mensa Annual Gathering (2013)**, Fort Worth, Texas  \n  *Presented on the craft of science fiction and the legacy of collaborative worldbuilding.*  \n  [View Press Release](https://www.us.mensa.org/newsroom/press-releases/american-mensae28099s-2013-annual-gathering-taking-place-july-3-7-in-fort-worth-texas/)\n\n---\n\nLet me know if you'd like this formatted for a website bio, recruiter résumé, or printable press kit."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "format for recruiter resume"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here's a **recruiter-optimized résumé** version of your CV, focused on technical achievements, clear structure, and keyword-rich formatting—ideal for scanning by both humans and applicant tracking systems (ATS):\n\n---\n\n# **Todd J. McCaffrey**  \n📍 Las Vegas, NV | 📧 todd@toddwriter.com | 🌐 www.toddmccaffrey.com | 📞 (818) 324-5127\n\n---\n\n## **Professional Summary**\n\nInnovative **Software Engineer and Technical Leader** with over **50 years of programming experience**, beginning with **6502 assembly** and progressing through modern languages including **Python, Java, C++, and JavaScript**. Strong background in **systems architecture**, **identity management**, **full-stack development**, and **embedded systems**. U.S. Army veteran and **New York Times bestselling author** with 78 published books, integrating deep technical knowledge with world-class communication and creative problem-solving.\n\n---\n\n## **Core Competencies**\n\n- Full-Stack Software Development (Java, Python, JavaScript)\n- Systems Integration & Security (LDAP, Oracle, BIND, Apache)\n- Embedded & Enterprise Architecture (C++, Assembly, UNIX/Linux)\n- Simulation, UI/UX, and Game Design (Unity, SolidWorks)\n- Technical Writing & Communication\n- Team Leadership & Project Management\n\n---\n\n## **Technical Skills**\n\n**Languages**: Python, Java, C++, C#, JavaScript, PHP, 6502 Assembly  \n**Tools/Frameworks**: Git, Unity, SolidWorks, Pro Tools, Oracle 9iAS, Adobe Suite  \n**Systems**: UNIX/Linux, Windows, Embedded Platforms  \n**Domains**: Identity Management, Network Security, Simulation, Publishing, Aerospace\n\n---\n\n## **Professional Experience**\n\n**Symas Corporation** – *Founder & Engineer*  \nBuilt LDAP-based identity and security systems. Engineered enterprise integration solutions for authentication and access control using Java and open-source tools.\n\n**PLATINUM Technology** – *Lead QA Engineer / Project Leader*  \nDirected cross-platform QA for enterprise tools; led integration efforts across UNIX, AIX, and Novell systems. Managed remote teams and shipped enterprise IAM products.\n\n**Locus Computing Corporation** – *Senior Software Engineer*  \nWorked on kernel-level UNIX tools and system administration utilities. Supported AIX environments and advanced software packaging/distribution tools.\n\n**Countrywide Financial**, **Oxelis**, **LRN** – *Senior Engineer / Java Developer*  \nDeveloped front-end and back-end systems for finance, legal, and compliance industries. Architected high-availability platforms and identity-aware middleware.\n\n---\n\n## **Education**\n\n**MFA, Fine Arts** – Claremont Graduate University  \n**B.Sc., Mechanical Engineering (Honors)** – Trinity College Dublin  \n**Coursework** – Pierce College & Norco College (California Community Colleges)\n\n---\n\n## **Publications & Intellectual Work**\n\n**Total Books Published**: 78 under names Todd McCaffrey, T.J. McCaffrey, Talla Hill, T.C. Storm  \n- *Dragon Harper*, *Dragon’s Time*, *Dragongirl* – Co-authored with Anne McCaffrey (*Pern series*)  \n- *Raw Space* – AI-infused space opera  \n- *The Steam Crown* – Technologically grounded steampunk  \n- *Winter Wyvern* – YA fantasy  \n- *L.A. Witch series* (as **T.J. McCaffrey**) – Urban fantasy  \n- *Ghost War series* (as **Talla Hill**) – Supernatural military thriller  \n\n---\n\n## **Speaking & Recognition**\n\n- **Speaker**, American Mensa Annual Gathering – “Collaborative Worldbuilding in Sci-Fi” (2013)  \n- **Guest Lecturer**, U.S. Air Force Academy – Fiction and Engineering  \n- Featured speaker at **DragonCon**, **WorldCon**, **Comic-Con International**\n\n---\n\nLet me know if you’d like this exported as `.docx`, `.pdf`, or as plain text for ATS résumé upload."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
