abase.\\n   - Tasks scheduled via Django admin (Django-Q) or periodic Celery Beat jobs.\\n\\n7. **Project Structure Created**\\n   - Full Django project structure with settings, URLs, and templates.\\n   - Instructions and example data included.\\n\\n### Files Included:\\n- `kdp_tracker/` — Django project settings and URLs.\\n- `sales/` — App containing models, admin, views, templates, and import script.\\n- `automation.py` — Playwright script to download the KDP CSV.\\n- `sample_kdp_report.csv` — Sample CSV data for testing import.\\n- `import_sales.py` — Management command for importing CSVs.\\n- `dashboard.html` — Template to view summarized sales data with interactive charts.\\n- `tasks.py` — Scheduled tasks for automation and import.\\n\\n### Next Steps:\\n- Expand dashboard with drill-down capabilities or filters by author/ASIN.\\n- Add user authentication for secured access.\\n\\nLet me know if you’d like the full Django project bundled as a zip file.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nScheduled CSV fetch and import using Celery and Django-Q has been added to the project description. Let me know if you’d like me to generate the full updated Django project for download."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
