{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Could you help me rewrite this ad copy for \"Winter Wyvern\"? She had dismal prospects… and a terrible choice to make.\n\nWould a dying dragon change her fate?\n\nOn the outskirts of the capital, sixteen-year old Krea, is fighting to survive. She’s bullied, attacked, and some say she’s cursed. She doesn’t believe them. This girl is a fighter.\n\nIn a meadow, surrounded by blue flowers, a dragon fights for her life and a chance at immortality. There’s just one problem, she needs a new twin soul.\n\nWhen Krea finds Wymarc, the dragon makes an offer. Is the dragon’s gift going to change her life for the better or send her to her doom?\nYou’ll love this fantasy for its characters you care about, meddlesome gods, and the brilliant story craft.\n\nGet it now."}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Discover the fate of sixteen-year-old Krea, fighting to survive on the outskirts of the capital. Bullied, attacked, and cursed by some, Krea refuses to back down. Her chance encounter with a dying dragon in a meadow surrounded by blue flowers brings forth an offer that could change her fate forever. The dragon needs a new twin soul for a chance at immortality, and Krea may be the one to provide it.\n\nBut as Krea considers the dragon's gift, she must weigh the consequences. Will it lead her to a better life, or send her to her doom? Winter Wyvern is a captivating fantasy tale featuring characters you'll care about, meddlesome gods, and expert story crafting. Don't miss your chance to experience this must-read novel. Get your copy now.\n\nDiscover the captivating tale of Winter Wyvern, where a young girl faces a daunting decision that could alter her destiny forever.\n\nMeet Krea, a sixteen-year-old who fights to survive on the outskirts of the capital despite being bullied, attacked, and deemed cursed. Yet, Krea remains a tenacious fighter, unwilling to succumb to her dismal prospects.\n\nIn a meadow, surrounded by enchanting blue flowers, a dragon battles for her life and the opportunity for immortality. But to achieve this, she needs a new twin soul. Enter Krea, who stumbles upon the dragon, Wymarc, and is presented with a life-changing offer.\n\nWill Wymarc's gift be the answer to Krea's prayers or the catalyst for her downfall? Find out in this enthralling fantasy, which boasts compelling characters, meddling gods, and masterful storytelling.\n\nDon't miss out on this must-read adventure. Get your copy of Winter Wyvern today.\n\nDiscover the fate of Krea, a sixteen-year-old girl fighting for survival on the outskirts of the capital. Bullied, attacked, and believed by some to be cursed, she refuses to give up. But when a dying dragon offers her a chance at immortality, Krea must make a terrible choice.\n\nIn a meadow surrounded by blue flowers, the dragon fights for her life and seeks a new twin soul. Enter Krea and the dragon makes her an offer. Will this gift change Krea's life for the better or lead her to her doom?\n\nDon't miss this gripping fantasy featuring captivating characters, meddlesome gods, and expert storytelling. Get your copy of Winter Wyvern today."}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
{"system": "", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Please write ad copy for \"L.A. Witch: Jesse's Ghost\" which is book 6 in the \"L.A. Witch\" series. My Name Is Holly Ivy McNee. I’m a witch.\n\nWhen The Order tried to use bus full\nof kids to kill us, we stopped them.\n\nOnly now, we’ve got thirty-four kids, \nall English.\n\nSo, we made them a school. Champion School.\n It’s haunted. But don’t worry! \nShe’s with us!"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Introducing \"L.A. Witch: Jesse's Ghost,\" the thrilling sixth installment in the \"L.A. Witch\" series by Holly Ivy McNee. Join us as we follow the adventures of Holly and her fellow witches as they face their toughest challenge yet. \n\nAfter thwarting The Order's attempt to harm innocent children, Holly and her coven find themselves responsible for thirty-four English children. But fear not, because Champion School, the new institution created for these children, is haunted by none other than Jesse's ghost, who has joined the witches in their fight against evil. \n\nAs Holly and her coven navigate the dangers of the supernatural world and protect the children under their care, they discover secrets about Jesse's past that shed new light on their mission. With danger lurking at every turn and new enemies emerging, can Holly and her coven keep the children safe and triumph over evil once and for all? \n\nDon't miss out on \"L.A. Witch: Jesse's Ghost,\" a gripping tale of magic, bravery, and resilience in the face of adversity. Get your copy today!\n\nLooking for a thrilling new read? Look no further than \"L.A. Witch: Jesse's Ghost,\" the latest installment in the action-packed \"L.A. Witch\" series.\n\nWritten by bestselling author Holly Ivy McNee, \"Jesse's Ghost\" picks up where the previous book left off, with our heroine and her fellow witches still reeling from their showdown with The Order. But when they discover a busload of English children in need of a safe haven, they rise to the challenge, creating the Champion School - a spooky, supernatural learning environment unlike any other.\n\nBut don't let the ghostly goings-on scare you away. With Holly Ivy McNee at the helm, you know you're in for a thrilling ride. So if you're looking for a book that will keep you on the edge of your seat from beginning to end, look no further than \"L.A. Witch: Jesse's Ghost.\" Get your copy today!"}], "tags": ["chatgpt", "v1"]}
